{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/10/30/8449877/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/10/30/8449877/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、もの忘れがひどくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我ながら困っています(´=ω=｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日傘と、時計と、リップを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3日間連続で失くしました(  ;  ;  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれも買ったばかりで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気に入っていたやつ...｡･ﾟ(ﾟ⊃ω⊂ﾟ)ﾟ･｡泣けるぜ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまりにひどいんで、最近は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手帳と携帯のアプリのWで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やることなすこと全部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メモするようにしています。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、結構前のブログで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(    夏休み中、富山の他にも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなところに行ったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のブログで書くね〜   )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言ったのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっかり忘れていました！( ๐_๐)〣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/10/30/8449877/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんと、色々"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旅行に行ってきたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は、福島県の会津と、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"栃木県の那須に行ってきました❀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/10/30/8449877/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このブログを読んでくださってるみんなへ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山写真を撮ってきたよっ(﹡ˆˆ﹡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『塔のへつり』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔ここは全て海だったんだそうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"吊橋を渡って入った洞窟の奥に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"虚空像菩薩が祀られていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/10/30/8449877/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『大内宿』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"江戸時代の町並みを残す宿場町です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キレイな花が咲いていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/10/30/8449877/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"用水路では、野菜や飲み物を冷やしていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/10/30/8449877/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し水に触れてみたら、びっくりするくらい冷たかったです。(*°_°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうかな、少しでも伝わったなあ？○゜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風情があってとっても素敵でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心が豊かになれた気がしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乳製品が好きなので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーズガーデンってとこにも寄って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々買ってきたので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"料理するのが楽しみです✡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、最近会えてなかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばあちゃんにもお土産を買って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旅行のあと、おばあちゃんのとこへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渡しに行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳細は...  モバメで送りますっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載せきれなかった写真たちも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またモバメでいっぱい送るねっ(＊´ω`＊)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/10/30/8449877/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キレイな景色と一緒に、動画も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんに撮ってもらったので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは755にアップします( ﹡ˆ_ˆ﹡ )♭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんもおばあちゃんも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難う。"},{"type":"br